SKILLS PACKAGES

As a group, all Travellers select one of the following
skill packages. These are collections of basic skills you
will often use while adventuring. Taking a skill package
ensures your group will at least have basic competency
in the situations that will come up in the campaign.

traveller creation

A

V

E

L

L

E

When you have collectively decided which skill package
is most suitable for the style of play and campaign you
will be embarking upon, each Traveller takes it in turns
to select an item from the package. Keep going until all
skills have been selected.

TRAVELLER SKILLS PACKAGE

TRADER SKILLS PACKAGE

This is an all-round skill package, good for a
campaign where the Travellers are trading one
week and blowing things up the next.

This skills package is for campaigns where
trading and commerce are the primary activities
of the Travellers.

